    "intro": "As a clinical psychologist, I am dedicated to providing a safe and welcoming space for you to explore your issues and find paths to a more balanced and satisfying life.",
    "profession": "Clinical Psychologist",
    "credentials": "CRP 06/65.368",
  "description": "I graduated in Psychology in 2002 from the Pontifical Catholic University of São Paulo, earned a master's degree in Clinical Psychology in 2007 from the Institute of Psychology at the University of São Paulo, and have been working as a judicial psychologist at the São Paulo State Court of Justice since 2015, with training in Lacanian psychoanalysis.",
